@startuml class Student {
    -studentId: String
    -name: String
    +viewAvailability()
    +bookRoom()
    +cancelBooking()
}

class Room {
    -roomId: String
    -isBlocked: Boolean
    +blockRoom()
    +unblockRoom()
}

class Booking {
    -bookingId: String
    -startTime: DateTime
    -endTime: DateTime
    -status: String
    +cancel()
}

note bottom of Booking
  R2: Active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.
  R1: Future start, duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.
  R3: Blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
end note

' why: A student can make zero or many bookings; each booking belongs to exactly one student
Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking

' why: A room can have zero or many bookings over time; each booking is for exactly one room
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking
@enduml